{
  "format": "ziffr.pack/2",
  "id": "ziffr/customer-support",
  "name": "Customer support",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "Tickets opened, closed and open, the old ones, first response and resolution times, satisfaction and reopens, with a weekly dashboard and a Workflow that asks for last week's figures on Monday.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziffr"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "ziffr": ">=0.11",
  "audience": {
    "functions": [
      "customer_support"
    ]
  },
  "listing": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/ziffr/ziffr/tree/main/packs"
  },
  "guide": {
    "whatItsFor": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For a support team that wants to see every week how much comes in and goes out, what is waiting, how fast it is answered and how customers rate it."
      }
    ],
    "beforeYouStart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "The week's figures from your ticket system: tickets opened, closed and open, those open over 7 days, first response and resolution times, satisfaction and reopen rate.",
          "Free room for the Metrics in your Workspace's size: the Set up form says how many it makes and how many fit."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "firstSteps": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Start here"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "items": [
          "Open **Settings**, then **Packs**. Under this Pack, choose **Set up from this Pack**.",
          "Keep the Metrics you want ticked, up to all 8, with the dashboard **Support weekly** and the Workflow **Monday support figures**. Tick **Ask me for their values** if you send the figures yourself, then choose **Set up**.",
          "To have someone else send a figure, open its Metric and add them under **Who submits**. Only a Submitter sees **Record a value** there.",
          "Send the first figures: open a Metric and choose **Record a value**, or answer the request Ziffr sends.",
          "Open **Dashboards** and then **Support weekly**. It fills as values come in."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "eachPart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "**Tickets opened**, **Tickets closed**, **Open tickets** and **Tickets open over 7 days**.",
          "**First response time** and **Resolution time** in hours, **Customer satisfaction** and **Reopen rate** as shares.",
          "The dashboard **Support weekly**.",
          "The Workflow **Monday support figures** asks for last week's figures on Monday and publishes them. A figure that is still missing after its Due Date is raised with the Metric's owner."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Can the figures come from a spreadsheet?"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Yes. **Fill from n8n**, under a Metric's **Who submits**, offers the Google Sheets template for the ticket counts and the satisfaction."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": {
    "metrics": [
      {
        "key": "tickets-opened",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Tickets opened",
          "description": "Support tickets that customers opened in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "target",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "tickets-closed",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Tickets closed",
          "description": "Support tickets that were resolved and closed in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "open-tickets",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Open tickets",
          "description": "Tickets still open at the end of the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "old-tickets",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Tickets open over 7 days",
          "description": "Tickets that have been open for more than seven days at the end of the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMax": 10,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "first-response",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "First response time",
          "description": "The average hours from a ticket arriving to the first human answer, for the tickets answered in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "hours",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "resolution-time",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Resolution time",
          "description": "The average hours from a ticket arriving to it being resolved, for the tickets resolved in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "hours",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "csat",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Customer satisfaction",
          "description": "The share of rated tickets where the customer was satisfied, in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMin": 85,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support",
            "Weekly report"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "reopen-rate",
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Reopen rate",
          "description": "The share of resolved tickets that the customer reopened, in the week.",
          "category": "Support",
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "average",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMax": 5,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ],
          "tags": [
            "Support"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "dashboards": [
      {
        "key": "support-weekly",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.dashboard-template/1",
          "name": "Support weekly",
          "description": "How much comes in and goes out, what is waiting, how fast it is answered and how customers rate it.",
          "slots": [
            {
              "label": "Open tickets",
              "suggests": "open-tickets"
            },
            {
              "label": "First response time",
              "suggests": "first-response"
            },
            {
              "label": "Customer satisfaction",
              "suggests": "csat"
            },
            {
              "label": "Tickets open over 7 days",
              "suggests": "old-tickets"
            },
            {
              "label": "Tickets opened",
              "suggests": "tickets-opened"
            },
            {
              "label": "Tickets closed",
              "suggests": "tickets-closed"
            }
          ],
          "widgets": [
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                1
              ],
              "x": 3,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "gauge",
              "slots": [
                2
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                3
              ],
              "x": 9,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "line",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 6,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "line",
              "slots": [
                1
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 6,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "bars",
              "slots": [
                4
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 10,
              "w": 6,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "bars",
              "slots": [
                5
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 10,
              "w": 6,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "workflows": [
      {
        "key": "monday-support-figures",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.workflow-template/1",
          "name": "Monday support figures",
          "description": "Last week's support figures are asked for on Monday and published.",
          "dueWorkingDays": 1,
          "steps": [
            {
              "type": "remind",
              "daysBefore": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "escalate",
              "to": "owner",
              "daysAfter": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "publish",
              "lock": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeds": [
    {
      "template": "google-sheets",
      "fills": [
        "tickets-opened",
        "tickets-closed",
        "open-tickets",
        "csat"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
